  "date": "October 2026",
  "abstract": "Covers the OpenTelemetry semantic conventions for generative AI with two version lines: the GenAI conventions (development), current, pinned to commit b31e9e8 of the semantic-conventions-genai repository (schema URL gen-ai-dev/1.42.0-dev, built on semantic conventions 1.44.0, draft posture build), and semantic conventions v1.36.0 or earlier, legacy, which existing instrumentations emit by default. It teaches inference, embeddings, retrieval, tool, agent, workflow and MCP spans; gen_ai.* attributes and well-known values; opt-in content capture; client, server, agent and token metrics; GenAI events; and the OTEL_SEMCONV_STABILITY_OPT_IN upgrade. SKILL.md holds the invariants and workflow; references split out the version lines and upgrade, spans, attributes, events and metrics, and versioning.",
